    "text": "HOLIDAYWhen is Easter 2026? Here are the dates for Easter, Good FridayCatherine MessierUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandMarch 27, 2026, 5:09 a.m. ETAs April rapidly approaches, it is almost Easter, meaning Christians all over New England are preparing to celebrate the death and resurrection of Jesus. The Christian holiday can take place anywhere from March 22 through April 25, and this year, it falls in early April. Because Easter is a moveable holiday, all the holidays of the Easter season, such as the season of Lent, Palm Sunday and Good Friday, move with it, which can be confusing.",
